  "network_policy": "Frozen RestTemplate passes URI/headers/encoded bytes to transport callbacks, not the private DTO. Transport/global effects remain opaque and poison externally reachable state. Only original getter/serializer-checked private operands may be preserved; this is not a read-only network contract.",
  "transport_scope": "Only exact SimpleClientHttpRequestFactory or its fixed Intercepting wrapper, optional fixed Sleuth TraceRestTemplateInterceptor, and DefaultResponseErrorHandler. Other components remain unsupported. Even these transport/global effects are not treated as read-only.",
  "decoder_roles": "Only actual post-constructor setter writes create message-field origins. Unwritten zero-initialized null fields have empty data origins. Repeated target-property writes and custom property decoders remain unsupported.",
  "scope": "Plain default Jackson conversion and Spring response identities; no HATEOAS/Sleuth support from this contract",
